 the accompanying riddles? Who knows, there might be a surprise in store for you!\n\nSo...are you ready for the egg hunt?!\n\nPractical info:\n\n    Free tour, included in a ticket to the Royal Military Museum\n    Booklet with assignments available at the reception desk at the Royal Military Museum. \n    Attention, bring your own writing utensils!\n    Reservation not required\n    The tour is available in NL, FR and EN.\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/militarymuseum.be","email":"info@whi.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009948"},"it":{"name":"The Easter Bunny is arriving at the Royal Military Museum!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/museearmee.be","email":"info@whi.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009948"},"cn":{"name":"The Easter Bunny is arriving at the Royal Military Museum!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/museearmee.be","email":"info@whi.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009948"},"fr":{"name":"Le lapin de P\u00e2ques arrive au Mus\u00e9e de l'Arm\u00e9e !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Cette ann\u00e9e, le lapin de P\u00e2ques a cach\u00e9 dans le mus\u00e9e des \u0153ufs aux couleurs de diff\u00e9rents pays... Serez-vous capable de les trouver et de r\u00e9soudre les \u00e9nigmes qui les accompagnent ? Qui sait, une belle surprise est peut-\u00eatre \u00e0 la cl\u00e9 !\n\nAlors... Pr\u00eat pour la chasse aux \u0153ufs ?!\n\nInfos pratiques :\n\n    Parcours gratuit, inclus dans le billet d'entr\u00e9e au Mus\u00e9e de l'Arm\u00e9e\n    Livret des missions disponible \u00e0 l'accueil du mus\u00e9e de l'Arm\u00e9e. \n    Attention, apportez vos ustensiles d'\u00e9criture !\n    R\u00e9servation non n\u00e9cessaire\n    Parcours disponible en NL, FR et EN.\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/museearmee.be","email":"info@whi.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009948"},"sp":{"name":"The Easter Bunny is arriving at the Royal Military Museum!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/museearmee.be","email":"info@whi.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009948"},"nl":{"name":"De Paashaas komt langs in het Legermuseum!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De Paashaas heeft dit jaar eitjes in de kleuren van verschillende landen verstopt in het museum. Lukt het jou om ze te vinden en de bijhorende puzzels op te lossen? Wie weet krijg jij wel een mooie verrassing!\n\nDus...klaar voor de eierenzoektocht?!\n\nPraktische info:\n\n    Gratis parcours, inbegrepen in een ticket voor het Legermuseum\n    Boekje met opdrachten te verkrijgen aan de onthaaldesk in het Legermuseum. \n    Opgelet, breng je eigen schrijfgerief mee!\n    Reservatie is niet nodig\n    Het parcours is beschikbaar in NL, FR en EN.\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/legermuseum.be","email":"info@whi.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009948"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2023-04-13T11:45:06+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+02:00","id":555,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu Real das For\u00e7as Armadas e da Hist\u00f3ria Militar","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Mais de dez s\u00e9culos de hist\u00f3ria e de t\u00e9cnicas militares passaram em revista por este museu. A\u00ed encontramos toda a pan\u00f3plia de guerra, da Idade M\u00e9dia \u00e0 \u00e9poca contempor\u00e2nea: armaduras medievais, armas de fogo, avi\u00f5es, carros blindados contempor\u00e2neos, uniformes e penteados militares\u2026\r\nDesde 1 de maio de 2017, o Museu Real das For\u00e7as Armadas e da Hist\u00f3ria Militar pertence ao War Heritage Institute, a nova institui\u00e7\u00e3o de refer\u00eancia para o patrim\u00f3nio militar e a mem\u00f3ria na B\u00e9lgica.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Royal Military Museum)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Here you\u2019ll find medieval armour and souvenirs from the Napoleonic campaigns, as well as a hundred or so aircraft and armoured vehicles from the two Great Wars. A breathtaking panoramic view awaits you at the top of the Arcade.\r\n\r\nSince May 1, 2017 the Royal Military Museum is part of the War Heritage Institute, the new reference institution for military heritage and remembrance in Belgium. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Plus de dix si\u00e8cles d\u2019histoire et de techniques militaires sont pass\u00e9s en revue dans ce mus\u00e9e. On y trouve toute la panoplie de guerre, du Moyen \u00c2ge \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque contemporaine: armures m\u00e9di\u00e9vales, armes \u00e0 feu, avions, blind\u00e9s contemporains, uniformes et coiffures militaires\u2026\r\n\r\nDepuis le 1er mai 2017, le Mus\u00e9e royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e appartient au War Heritage Institute, la nouvelle institution de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence pour le patrimoine militaire et la m\u00e9moire en Belgique. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Real de la Armada e Historia militar (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El museo posee alrededor de 100.000 objetos(armas, uniformes, maquetas, documentos...), siendo as\u00ed unos de los museos militares m\u00e1s grandes del mundo. Encontrar\u00e1s: una secci\u00f3n de armas y armaduras de la Edad Media, una preciosa colecci\u00f3n del Imperio franc\u00e9s, la Armada belga desde 1831 a 1914 con vitrinas dedicadas al rey Leopoldo l y Leopoldo ll, el desarrollo de la tecnolog\u00eda armament\u00edstica(hacia la mitad del s.XX), la Primera y Segunda Guerra Mundial(uniformes, materiales fotos y documentos), veh\u00edculos armados y barcos de guerra. La secci\u00f3n \"a\u00e9rea\" del museo ofrece una gama completa de aviones, alrededor de 80 son expuestos.\u00a1Y no te pierdas nuestros juegos educativos para todas las \u00e9pocas!. \r\n\r\nLos centros de documentaci\u00f3n est\u00e1n abiertos al p\u00fablico.\r\n\r\nEspectacular vista panor\u00e1mica de la ciudad desde la galer\u00eda.\r\n\r\nLas exposiciones temporales pueden ser de varios temas.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Koninklijk Legermuseum)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Meer dan tien eeuwen militaire geschiedenis passeren de revue in dit museum. Je krijgt er een overzicht van de ingrijpende veranderingen die door de jaren heen hebben plaatsgegrepen op het gebied van bewapening en militaire technologie, van de middeleeuwen tot op heden: wapens, harnassen, pantsers, vliegtuigen, uniformen, \u2026\r\n\r\nSinds 1 mei 2017 is het Koninklijk Legermuseum onderdeel van het War Heritage Institute, de nieuwe instelling voor militair erfgoed en herinnering in Belgi\u00eb. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":127,"location":{"lat":50.84086428,"lon":4.39335612},"region":"brussels","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"last_updated_at":"2023-04-13T11:45:06+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+02:00","id":555,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu Real das For\u00e7as Armadas e da Hist\u00f3ria Militar","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Mais de dez s\u00e9culos de hist\u00f3ria e de t\u00e9cnicas militares passaram em revista por este museu. A\u00ed encontramos toda a pan\u00f3plia de guerra, da Idade M\u00e9dia \u00e0 \u00e9poca contempor\u00e2nea: armaduras medievais, armas de fogo, avi\u00f5es, carros blindados contempor\u00e2neos, uniformes e penteados militares\u2026\r\nDesde 1 de maio de 2017, o Museu Real das For\u00e7as Armadas e da Hist\u00f3ria Militar pertence ao War Heritage Institute, a nova institui\u00e7\u00e3o de refer\u00eancia para o patrim\u00f3nio militar e a mem\u00f3ria na B\u00e9lgica.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Royal Military Museum)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Here you\u2019ll find medieval armour and souvenirs from the Napoleonic campaigns, as well as a hundred or so aircraft and armoured vehicles from the two Great Wars. A breathtaking panoramic view awaits you at the top of the Arcade.\r\n\r\nSince May 1, 2017 the Royal Military Museum is part of the War Heritage Institute, the new reference institution for military heritage and remembrance in Belgium. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Plus de dix si\u00e8cles d\u2019histoire et de techniques militaires sont pass\u00e9s en revue dans ce mus\u00e9e. On y trouve toute la panoplie de guerre, du Moyen \u00c2ge \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque contemporaine: armures m\u00e9di\u00e9vales, armes \u00e0 feu, avions, blind\u00e9s contemporains, uniformes et coiffures militaires\u2026\r\n\r\nDepuis le 1er mai 2017, le Mus\u00e9e royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e appartient au War Heritage Institute, la nouvelle institution de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence pour le patrimoine militaire et la m\u00e9moire en Belgique. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Real de la Armada e Historia militar (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El museo posee alrededor de 100.000 objetos(armas, uniformes, maquetas, documentos...), siendo as\u00ed unos de los museos militares m\u00e1s grandes del mundo. Encontrar\u00e1s: una secci\u00f3n de armas y armaduras de la Edad Media, una preciosa colecci\u00f3n del Imperio franc\u00e9s, la Armada belga desde 1831 a 1914 con vitrinas dedicadas al rey Leopoldo l y Leopoldo ll, el desarrollo de la tecnolog\u00eda armament\u00edstica(hacia la mitad del s.XX), la Primera y Segunda Guerra Mundial(uniformes, materiales fotos y documentos), veh\u00edculos armados y barcos de guerra. La secci\u00f3n \"a\u00e9rea\" del museo ofrece una gama completa de aviones, alrededor de 80 son expuestos.\u00a1Y no te pierdas nuestros juegos educativos para todas las \u00e9pocas!. \r\n\r\nLos centros de documentaci\u00f3n est\u00e1n abiertos al p\u00fablico.\r\n\r\nEspectacular vista panor\u00e1mica de la ciudad desde la galer\u00eda.\r\n\r\nLas exposiciones temporales pueden ser de varios temas.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Koninklijk Legermuseum)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Meer dan tien eeuwen militaire geschiedenis passeren de revue in dit museum. Je krijgt er een overzicht van de ingrijpende veranderingen die door de jaren heen hebben plaatsgegrepen op het gebied van bewapening en militaire technologie, van de middeleeuwen tot op heden: wapens, harnassen, pantsers, vliegtuigen, uniformen, \u2026\r\n\r\nSinds 1 mei 2017 is het Koninklijk Legermuseum onderdeel van het War Heritage Institute, de nieuwe instelling voor militair erfgoed en herinnering in Belgi\u00eb. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":127,"location":{"lat":50.84086428,"lon":4.39335612},"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/1c707aedc07c0ff71afc839fc23675aa2df543a3.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"ratio":1.78,"oEmbed_height":1080,"oEmbed_width":1920,"translations":{"de":{"title"