reat names in modern and contemporary art, from Belgium and beyond.","performers":"Fran\u00e7ois de Coninck (Curator), Emmanuel Van de Putte (Director Sotheby's Belgium), Gwendolyn Grolig (Director Contemporary Art Sotheby's Belgium), Deborah Quackelbeen (General Director Sotheby's Belgium), Marianna Lora (Director Old masters and Jewels Sotheby's Belgium), Laura Bogaerts (Watches and Asian Art Sotheby's Belgium), Alexine Delens (Handbags and Operations), Louise Henricot (Events) ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.sothebys.com\/en\/about\/locations\/brussels?locale=en","email":"louise.henricot@sothebys.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009295"},"it":{"name":"Who's Afraid of Red, Yellow and Black?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.sothebys.com\/en\/about\/locations\/brussels?locale=en","email":"louise.henricot@sothebys.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009295"},"cn":{"name":"Who's Afraid of Red, Yellow and Black?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.sothebys.com\/en\/about\/locations\/brussels?locale=en","email":"louise.henricot@sothebys.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009295"},"fr":{"name":"Who's Afraid of Red, Yellow and Black?","shortdescr":"Sotheby's Belgium a le plaisir de c\u00e9l\u00e9brer son 50e anniversaire en Belgique avec une exposition unique en son genre dans sa galerie de Bruxelles.","longdescr":"En clin d\u2019\u0153il \u00e0 une \u0153uvre magistrale de Barnett Newman (Who's Afraid of Red, Yellow and Blue?) et en guise de pr\u00e9texte \u00e0 un voyage essentiellement chromatique, nous nous sommes laiss\u00e9 guider, dans le choix des \u0153uvres, par les trois couleurs flottant \u00e0 la surface souple du drapeau belge \u2013 noir, jaune, rouge. Une exposition qui c\u00e9l\u00e8bre les cinquante ans de Sotheby\u2019s en Belgique en r\u00e9unissant des grands noms de l\u2019art moderne et contemporain. ","performers":"Fran\u00e7ois de Coninck (Commissaire d'exposition), Emmanuel Van de Putte (Director Sotheby's), Gwendolyn Grolig (Director Art Contemporain Sotheby's), Deborah Quackelbeen (Directrice G\u00e9n\u00e9ral Sotheby's), Marianna Lora (Directrice Vieux Ma\u00eetres et Bijoux Sotheby's), Laura Bogaerts (Montres et Art Asiatique Sotheby's), Alexine Delens (Sacs \u00e0 Main et Op\u00e9rations), Louise Henricot (Events) ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.sothebys.com\/en\/about\/locations\/brussels?locale=en","email":"louise.henricot@sothebys.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009295"},"sp":{"name":"Who's Afraid of Red, Yellow and Black?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.sothebys.com\/en\/about\/locations\/brussels?locale=en","email":"louise.henricot@sothebys.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009295"},"nl":{"name":"Who's Afraid of Red, Yellow and Black?","shortdescr":"Sotheby's Belgium viert haar 50ste verjaardag in Belgi\u00eb met een unieke tentoonstelling in de galerie in Brussel.","longdescr":"Ge\u00efnspireerd door het meesterwerk van Barnett Newman (Who's Afraid of Red, Yellow and Blue?), en als voorwendsel voor een in wezen chromatische reis, lieten we ons bij onze keuze van werken leiden door de drie kleuren die drijven op het soepele oppervlak van de Belgische vlag \u2013 zwart, geel en rood. Deze tentoonstelling viert de vijftigste verjaardag van Sotheby\u2019s Belgi\u00eb door enkele grote namen uit de moderne en hedendaagse kunst, uit Belgi\u00eb en daarbuiten, samen te brengen. ","performers":"Fran\u00e7ois de Coninck (Curator), Emmanuel Van de Putte (Directeur Sotheby's), Gwendolyn Grolig (Directeur Hedendaagse Kunst Sotheby's), Deborah Quackelbeen (Managing Director Sotheby's), Marianna Lora (Directeur Oude Meesters en Juwelen Sotheby's), Laura Bogaerts (Horloges en Aziatische Kunst Sotheby's), Alexine Delens (Handtassen en Operaties), Louise Henricot (Evenementen).","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.sothebys.com\/en\/about\/locations\/brussels?locale=en","email":"louise.henricot@sothebys.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009295"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2024-04-05T11:33:48+02:00","published_at":"2024-04-05T10:10:16+02:00","id":50001448,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Sotheby's Brussels Gallery","address_street_name":"Avenue Louise","address_street_number":"251","address_street_box":"15","email":"brussels.reception@sothebys.com","website":"https:\/\/www.sothebys.com\/en\/about\/locations\/brussels?locale=en","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 71 82","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Louise, 251 \/ 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Sotheby's Brussels Gallery","address_street_name":"Avenue Louise","address_street_number":"251","address_street_box":"15","email":"brussels.reception@sothebys.com","website":"https:\/\/www.sothebys.com\/en\/about\/locations\/brussels?locale=en","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 71 82","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Louise, 251 \/ 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Sotheby's Brussels Gallery","