ssels with 500m2 of spatial labyrinth to hide in. Think of yourself as a superhero, shoot at your enemies without hurting them, gain super powers and pull your head out into the stars. \r\n\r\nSpace Team Games: new in Belgium 250m2, 11 mini Challeges & Escape Games (action, reflection and agility), a kind of futuristic \"Fort Boyard\" to be achieved in 1H with timed collective games for 2 to 6 people.\r\n\r\nAccessible to almost everyone, from 10 years old. \r\nIdeal location, close to Ring & airport, Free Carrefour Parking (1 rue de l\u2019Escadron), Thieffry Metro at 200m and public transports. Bike friendly \r\nCapacity: 200 persons\r\nA la carte services (including privatisation, meeting room, drinks & catering) \r\nCompetitive pricing: From 20\u20ac per person for 1H of activity.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Space Fun Games","address_street_name":"Galerie Carrefour Shopping Saint Michel","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@spacefungame.com","website":"http:\/\/www.spacefungame.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 720 01 23","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Galerie Carrefour Shopping Saint Michel","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Space Fun Games","address_street_name":"Galerie Carrefour Shopping Saint Michel","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@spacefungame.com","website":"http:\/\/www.spacefungame.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 720 01 23","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Galerie Carrefour Shopping Saint Michel","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Spac