osition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[46,36],"translations":{"de":["Multidisziplin\u00e4r","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Multidisciplinary","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Multidisciplinare","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Pluridisciplinaire","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Multidisciplinar","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Multidisciplinair","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Belexpo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.belexpo.brussels\/","email":"info@belexpo.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 20 25 00","phone_booking":"+32 485 20 25 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549228"},"pt":{"name":"Belexpo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.belexpo.brussels\/","email":"info@belexpo.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 20 25 00","phone_booking":"+32 485 20 25 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549228"},"en":{"name":"Belexpo","shortdescr":"Become climate heroes thanks to BELEXPO, the fun and interactive parcours about climate and the cities of tomorrow, created by Brussels Environment.","longdescr":"Take up challenges and imagine a better life ! In this experience, try out a different kind of mobility, grow vegetables virtually, learn how to consume in a more sustainable way, discover jobs related to the environment or reduce energy consumption at home.\nIn addition, Clim' Avatar, BELEXPO's artificial intelligence, helps visitors to understand climate change and to better grasp the challenges of the missions to be accomplished thanks to a brand new animation.\nDesigned for young people aged 10 to 16 and their families, BELEXPO can be experienced alone or in groups (schools, youth movements, families, birthday parties). Learning and fun guaranteed!\n\nOpen first weekend of the month: 10am-6pm.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.belexpo.brussels\/","email":"info@belexpo.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 20 25 00","phone_booking":"+32 485 20 25 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549228"},"it":{"name":"Belexpo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.belexpo.brussels\/","email":"info@belexpo.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 20 25 00","phone_booking":"+32 485 20 25 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549228"},"cn":{"name":"Belexpo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.belexpo.brussels\/","email":"info@belexpo.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 20 25 00","phone_booking":"+32 485 20 25 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549228"},"fr":{"name":"Belexpo","shortdescr":"Devenez des h\u00e9ros climatiques gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 BELEXPO, le parcours ludique et interactif sur le climat et les villes de demain, cr\u00e9\u00e9 par Bruxelles Environnement.","longdescr":"Relevez des d\u00e9fis et imaginez une vie\/ ville meilleure ! Dans ce parcours, exp\u00e9rimentez une autre mobilit\u00e9, faites pousser des l\u00e9gumes virtuellement, apprenez \u00e0 consommer de mani\u00e8re plus durable, d\u00e9couvrez des m\u00e9tiers li\u00e9s \u00e0 l\u2019environnement ou encore diminuez les consommations \u00e9nerg\u00e9tiques chez vous.\nEn outre, Clim\u2019 Avatar, l\u2019intelligence artificielle de BELEXPO, aide les visiteurs \u00e0 comprendre le changement climatique et \u00e0 mieux cerner les enjeux des missions \u00e0 accomplir gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une toute nouvelle animation.\nCon\u00e7u pour les jeunes de 10 \u00e0 16 ans et leur famille, BELEXPO se vit seul ou en groupe (\u00e9coles, mouvements de jeunesse, famille, f\u00eate d\u2019anniversaire). Apprentissage et amusement garanti !\n\nOuverture le le premier week-end du mois :10h-18h.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.belexpo.brussels\/","email":"info@belexpo.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 20 25 00","phone_booking":"+32 485 20 25 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549228"},"sp":{"name":"Belexpo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.belexpo.brussels\/","email":"info@belexpo.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 20 25 00","phone_booking":"+32 485 20 25 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549228"},"nl":{"name":"Belexpo","shortdescr":"Word klimaathelden dankzij BELEXPO, de ludieke en interactieve parcours over het klimaat en de steden van morgen, gecre\u00eberd door Leefmilieu Brussel.","longdescr":"Ga uitdagingen aan en stel je een beter leven voor! In dit parcours kan je een ander soort mobiliteit uitproberen, virtueel groenten kweken, leren hoe je duurzamer kan consumeren, beroepen ontdekken die verband houden met het milieu of het energieverbruik thuis verminderen.\nBovendien helpt Clim' Avatar, de artifici\u00eble intelligentie van BELEXPO, de bezoekers de klimaatverandering te begrijpen en de uitdagingen van de te volbrengen missies beter te begrijpen dankzij een gloednieuwe animatie.\nOntworpen voor jongeren van 10 tot 16 jaar en hun familie, kan BELEXPO alleen of in groepen (scholen, jeugdbewegingen, families, verjaardagsfeestjes) worden ervaren. Leren en plezier gegarandeerd!\n\nGeopend het eerste weekend van de maand: 10.00-18.00 uur.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.belexpo.brussels\/","email":"info@belexpo.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 20 25 00","phone_booking":"+32 485 20 25 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549228"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2023-04-13T11:47:09+02:00","published_at":"2015-10-01T09:52:00+02:00","id":262448,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The architecture of the new Brussels Environment building, next to the historic Royal Warehouse, could not be called inconspicuous. The building had to be passive, given that the Brussels regional institution advocates energy savings on a day-to-day basis, particularly where construction in Brussels is concerned. It therefore unites all the characteristics of a modern, highly energy-efficient building, open to the surrounding green setting and the Tour & Taxis site. Opened in late 2014, the Brussels Environment head office is largely triple-glazed to capture the sun\u2019s light and heat. Its design also includes areas for relaxation and socialising around a south-facing atrium. It is intended to serve as a model in terms of both energy use and integration into the environment.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"L\u2019architecture du nouveau b\u00e2timent de Bruxelles Environnement ne passe pas inaper\u00e7ue, \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de l\u2019historique Entrep\u00f4t Royal. L\u2019immeuble se devait d\u2019\u00eatre passif, puisque cette institution r\u00e9gionale bruxelloise pr\u00e9conise au quotidien les \u00e9conomies d\u2019\u00e9nergie, notamment au niveau de la construction \u00e0 Bruxelles. L\u2019\u00e9difice rassemble donc toutes les caract\u00e9ristiques d\u2019un b\u00e2timent moderne, tr\u00e8s \u00e9conome en \u00e9nergie, ouvert sur la nature environnante et sur le site de Tour et Taxis. Inaugur\u00e9 fin 2014, le si\u00e8ge administratif de Bruxelles Environnement est en grande partie vitr\u00e9 \u2013 triple vitrage \u2013 pour r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer la lumi\u00e8re et la chaleur du soleil. Mais il est aussi con\u00e7u pour proposer des lieux de convivialit\u00e9, rassembl\u00e9s autour d\u2019un atrium orient\u00e9 vers le sud. Il se veut un mod\u00e8le, tant en mati\u00e8re \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique qu\u2019en termes d\u2019int\u00e9gration dans son environnement.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La arquitectura del nuevo edificio Bruxelles Environnement, al lado de la hist\u00f3rica Royal Warehouse, no puede pasar desapercibida. El edificio tuvo que ser pasivo, dado que la instituci\u00f3n regional de Bruselas aboga por el ahorro de energ\u00eda diario, que es particularmente el inter\u00e9s de la construcci\u00f3n en Bruselas. De esta manera une todas las caracter\u00edsticas de un edificio moderno y de alta eficiencia energ\u00e9tica abierto a las zonas verdes y Tour & Taxis. Abierto a finales de 2014, la oficina principal del Bruxelles Environnement est\u00e1 triplemente acristalada para dejar pasar la luz y el calor. Su dise\u00f1o tambi\u00e9n incluye \u00e1reas de descanso para relacionarse en el vest\u00edbulo al sur del edificio. La intenci\u00f3n es que sirva como modelo en t\u00e9rminos tanto energ\u00e9ticos como de integraci\u00f3n en el medio ambiente.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Leefmilieu Brussel","address_street_name":"Havenlaan","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@leefmilieu.brussels","website":"https:\/\/leefmilieu.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Havenlaan, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De architectuur van het nieuwe gebouw van Leefmilieu Brussel gaat niet onopgemerkt voorbij, naast het historische Koninklijke Pakhuis. Het moest wel een passiefgebouw zijn, aangezien deze Brusselse instantie elke dag advies geeft over energiebesparing, onder meer voor gebouwen in Brussel. Het heeft dus alle kenmerken van een modern en zeer energiezuinig gebouw, dat openstaat naar de omringende natuur en naar de site van Thurn & Taxis. Het hoofdkantoor van Leefmilieu Brussel werd eind 2014 geopend. Het bestaat voor een groot deel uit raampartijen \u2013 met driedubbel glas \u2013 om het licht en de zonnewarmte binnen te laten. Maar het is ook ontworpen met het oog op de gebruiker, met gezellige ruimtes die zijn gegroepeerd rond een naar het zuiden gericht atrium. Dit gebouw heeft een voorbeeldfunctie, zowel in het energieverbruik als in de integratie in de omgeving.\r\n\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":22448,"location":{"lat":50.86573978,"lon":4.3509828},"region":"brussels","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"last_updated_at":"2023-04-13T11:47:09+02:00","published_at":"2015-10-01T09:52:00+02:00","id":262448,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 C \/ 3000","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Bruxelles Environnement","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 C","address_street_box":"3000","email":"info@environnement.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.environnement.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 775 75 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Avenue 