ull],"fr":["Design","Galeries d'art"],"sp":["Dise\u00f1o","Galer\u00edas de arte"],"nl":["Design","Galeries"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Brussels Jewellery Week","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxelles.be\/brussels-jewellery-week","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009969"},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Jewellery Week","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxelles.be\/brussels-jewellery-week","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009969"},"en":{"name":"Brussels Jewellery Week","shortdescr":"Van 25 april tot 5 mei 2024 staan hedendaagse juwelen in de schijnwerpers op verschillende locaties in Brussel. \nDe Europese hoofdstad brengt gevestigde en opkomende kunstenaars, verzamelaars en een internationaal publiek samen voor de 2e editie van de Brussels Jewellery Week. \nOp het programma: tentoonstellingen (MAD Brussel, Mont-de-Pi\u00e9t\u00e9), stadsrondleidingen, conferenties, workshops, enz.","longdescr":"From 25 April to 5 May 2024, contemporary jewellery will be in the spotlight at various venues in Brussels. \nThe European capital is bringing together established and emerging artists, collectors and an international public for the 2nd edition of Brussels Jewellery Week. \nOn the programme: exhibitions (MAD Brussels, Mont-de-Pi\u00e9t\u00e9), city tours, conferences, workshops,...\n\u2139\ufe0f More info: https:\/\/www.brusselsjewelleryweek.com\/\n\nParticle[s] exhibition at Mad Brussels\nIn the world of contemporary jewellery, every material is made up of the same tiny particles which, together in subtle arrangements, form a work of art. \n\u2139\ufe0f More info: https:\/\/www.brusselsjewelleryweek.com\/\n\nBe.NEXT exhibition at the Mont-de-Pi\u00e9t\u00e9 art centre\nThis exhibition is dedicated to promoting Belgian schools and academies of contemporary jewellery. Showcasing emerging talent from 12 institutions, it gives the public a chance to discover the diversity and quality of the teaching on offer in our country.\n\u2139\ufe0f More info: https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/blogs\/news\/expo-be-next-2024-de-la-brussels-jewellery-week","performers":"Many established and emerging contemporary jewellers.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxelles.be\/brussels-jewellery-week","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009969"},"it":{"name":"Brussels Jewellery Week","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxelles.be\/brussels-jewellery-week","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009969"},"cn":{"name":"Brussels Jewellery Week","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxelles.be\/brussels-jewellery-week","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009969"},"fr":{"name":"Brussels Jewellery Week","shortdescr":"Du 25 avril au 5 mai 2024, dans diff\u00e9rents lieux \u00e0 Bruxelles, le bijou contemporain sera \u00e0 l'honneur. \nLa capitale europ\u00e9enne r\u00e9unit des artistes \u00e9tablis et \u00e9mergents, des collectionneurs et un public international pour la 2e \u00e9dition de la Brussels Jewellery Week. \nAu programme : des expositions (MAD Brussels, Mont-de-Pi\u00e9t\u00e9), des visites de la ville, des conf\u00e9rences, des ateliers,...","longdescr":"Du 25 avril au 5 mai 2024, dans diff\u00e9rents lieux \u00e0 Bruxelles, le bijou contemporain sera \u00e0 l'honneur. \nLa capitale europ\u00e9enne r\u00e9unit des artistes \u00e9tablis et \u00e9mergents, des collectionneurs et un public international pour la 2e \u00e9dition de la Brussels Jewellery Week. \nAu programme : des expositions (MAD Brussels, Mont-de-Pi\u00e9t\u00e9), des visites de la ville, des conf\u00e9rences, des ateliers,...\n\u2139\ufe0f Plus d'infos : https:\/\/www.brusselsjewelleryweek.com\/\n\nExposition Particle[s] au Mad Brussels\nDans l'univers de la joaillerie contemporaine, on constate que chaque mat\u00e9riau est constitu\u00e9 des m\u00eames minuscules particules qui, ensemble, dans des arrangements subtils, forment une \u0153uvre d'art. \n\u2139\ufe0f Plus d'infos : https:\/\/www.brusselsjewelleryweek.com\/\n\nExposition Be.NEXT au centre d'art du Mont-de-Pi\u00e9t\u00e9\nElle est d\u00e9di\u00e9e \u00e0 la promotion des \u00e9coles et acad\u00e9mies belges ax\u00e9es sur le bijou contemporain. Pr\u00e9sentant les talents \u00e9mergents de 12 institutions, elle offre au public la possibilit\u00e9 de d\u00e9couvrir la diversit\u00e9 et la qualit\u00e9 de l'enseignement propos\u00e9 dans notre pays.\n\u2139\ufe0f Plus d'infos : https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/blogs\/news\/expo-be-next-2024-de-la-brussels-jewellery-week","performers":"De nombreux bijoutiers contemporains \u00e9tablis et \u00e9mergents.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxelles.be\/brussels-jewellery-week","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009969"},"sp":{"name":"Brussels Jewellery Week","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxelles.be\/brussels-jewellery-week","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009969"},"nl":{"name":"Brussels Jewellery Week","shortdescr":"Van 25 april tot 5 mei 2024 staan hedendaagse juwelen in de schijnwerpers op verschillende locaties in Brussel. \nDe Europese hoofdstad brengt gevestigde en opkomende kunstenaars, verzamelaars en een internationaal publiek samen voor de 2de editie van de Brussels Jewellery Week. Op het programma: tentoonstellingen (MAD Brussel, Berg van Barmhartigheid), stadswandelingen, conferenties, workshops,...","longdescr":"Van 25 april tot 5 mei 2024 staan hedendaagse juwelen in de schijnwerpers op verschillende locaties in Brussel. \nDe Europese hoofdstad brengt gevestigde en opkomende kunstenaars, verzamelaars en een internationaal publiek samen voor de 2de editie van de Brussels Jewellery Week. Op het programma: tentoonstellingen (MAD Brussel, Berg van Barmhartigheid), stadswandelingen, conferenties, workshops,...\n\ufe0f Meer info: https:\/\/www.brusselsjewelleryweek.com\/\n\nTentoonstelling Particule[s] bij Mad Brussel\nIn de wereld van hedendaagse juwelen bestaat elk materiaal uit dezelfde minuscule deeltjes die samen in subtiele ordeningen een kunstwerk vormen. \n\ufe0f Meer info: https:\/\/www.brusselsjewelleryweek.com\/\n\nBe.NEXT tentoonstelling in de kunstcentrum van de Berg van Barmhartigheid:\nDeze tentoonstelling is gewijd aan het promoten van Belgische scholen en academies voor hedendaagse juwelen. Ze toont opkomend talent uit 12 instellingen en geeft het publiek de kans om de diversiteit en kwaliteit van het onderwijsaanbod in ons land te ontdekken.\n\ufe0f Meer info: https:\/\/montdepiete.be\/nl\/blogs\/news\/expo-be-next-2024-de-la-brussels-jewellery-week","performers":"Veel gevestigde en opkomende hedendaagse juweliers.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxelles.be\/brussels-jewellery-week","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009969"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2023-06-17T21:57:18+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:40+02:00","id":221323,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mont de Pi\u00e9t\u00e9 (Caisse Publique de Pr\u00eats)","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Ghislain","ad