ndi, mardi, mercredi, jeudi, vendredi, samedi et dimanche: de 08:00 \u00e0 21:00"],"nl":["maandag, dinsdag, woensdag, donderdag, vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag: van 08:00 tot 21:00"]},"date_start":"2024-04-20","date_end":"2024-06-23","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255],"translations":{"de":["Barrierefrei"],"pt":[null],"en":["Accessible"],"it":["Accessibile"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Accessible"],"sp":["Habilitado"],"nl":["Toegankelijk"]}},"visit_profile":{"list":[337],"translations":{"de":["Highlight"],"pt":[null],"en":["Highlight"],"it":["Highlight"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Highlight"],"sp":["Highlight"],"nl":["Highlight"]},"values":null,"externalReferenceList":null},"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["exterior"],"opening":{"day":"2024-04-20","end":"18:30:00","is_only_by_appointment":null,"start":"14:30:00","timestamp":"2024-04-20T14:30:00"}},{"id":50009618,"date_start":"2024-04-13","date_end":"2024-08-25","date_next":"2024-04-30","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-04-30T02:01:44+02:00","published_at":"2024-04-23T09:37:53+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":true,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":298348,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"festival","ranking":0.3094392555741853,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":118,"translations":{"de":"Festival","pt":null,"en":"Festival","it":"Festival","cn":null,"fr":"Festival","sp":"Festival","nl":"Festival"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Horizon 2030","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.horizon2030bxl.be","email":"info@bmeo.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009618"},"pt":{"name":"Horizon 2030","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.horizon2030bxl.be","email":"info@bmeo.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009618"},"en":{"name":"Horizon 2030","shortdescr":"Horizon 2030 breathes new life into the Cinquantenaire to make it Brussels' leading socio-cultural center by 2030. Thanks to the support of the National Lottery, the \"Horizon 2030\" project offers a rich program combining heritage, knowledge and culture, transforming the site into a meeting point for the people of Brussels.\n","longdescr":"Thanks to the support of National Lottery players, the non-profit organization Horizon 50-200 is creating a new dynamic and a strong ambition for 2030.\n\nIn the run-up to Belgium's bicentenary in 2030, the Cinquantenaire invites you to rediscover its exceptional museum collections and the park in a new light, one of innovation and encounters. The Horizon 2030 event offers a range of festivities and activities at this iconic site, providing unforgettable moments for friends and family alike.\n\nBetween tradition and innovation, Horizon 2030 brings together already popular events such as the Bright Festival, the 20 km of Brussels and the F\u00eate Nationale, as well as new and upcoming events based on heritage, scientific research and culture. You'll be able to discover exhibitions, workshops, talks and moments of relaxation that will take place in the park and its museums, with the support of our institutions and partners.\n\nFrom spring through to the end of summer, we look forward to seeing you at Cinquantenaire.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.horizon2030bxl.be","email":"info@bmeo.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009618"},"it":{"name":"Horizon 2030","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.horizon2030bxl.be","email":"info@bmeo.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009618"},"cn":{"name":"Horizon 2030","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.horizon2030bxl.be","email":"info@bmeo.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009618"},"fr":{"name":"Horizon 2030","shortdescr":"Horizon 2030 donne une nouvelle vie au Cinquantenaire pour en faire le principal centre socio-culturel de Bruxelles d'ici 2030. Gr\u00e2ce au soutien de la Loterie Nationale, le projet \"Horizon 2030\" offre une programmation riche m\u00ealant patrimoine, savoir et culture, transformant ce lieu en un point de rencontre incontournable pour les Bruxellois.","longdescr":"L\u2019asbl Horizon 50-200 impulse une nouvelle dynamique et une ambition forte \u00e0 l\u2019horizon 2030, gr\u00e2ce au soutien des joueurs de la Loterie Nationale.\n\u00c0 l\u2019horizon du bicentenaire de la Belgique en 2030, le Cinquantenaire vous invite \u00e0 red\u00e9couvrir ses collections mus\u00e9ales exceptionnelles et \u00e0 red\u00e9couvrir le parc sous un nouveau regard, celui de l\u2019innovation et de la rencontre. L\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nement Horizon 2030 propose un \u00e9ventail de festivit\u00e9s et d\u2019activit\u00e9s dans ce lieu iconique, qui vous feront passer des moments inoubliables entre amis ou en famille.\nEntre tradition et innovation, Horizon 2030 rassemble des \u00e9v\u00e9nements d\u00e9j\u00e0 populaires tels que le Bright Festival, les 20 km de Bruxelles, la F\u00eate Nationale, mais aussi des \u00e9v\u00e9nements in\u00e9dits \u00e0 venir, articul\u00e9s autour du patrimoine, de la recherche scientifique et de la culture. Vous pourrez y d\u00e9couvrir des expositions, des ateliers, des prises de parole et des moments de d\u00e9tente qui prendront place dans le parc et dans les mus\u00e9es qui l\u2019habitent, avec le soutien des institutions et de nos partenaires.\nDu printemps et jusqu\u2019\u00e0 la fin de l\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9, on se donne rendez-vous au Cinquantenaire.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.horizon2030bxl.be","email":"info@bmeo.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009618"},"sp":{"name":"Horizon 2030","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.horizon2030bxl.be","email":"info@bmeo.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009618"},"nl":{"name":"Horizon 2030","shortdescr":"Horizon 2030 blaast het Jubelpark nieuw leven in om er tegen 2030 het belangrijkste sociaal-culturele centrum van Brussel van te maken. Dankzij de steun van de Nationale Loterij biedt het project \"Horizon 2030\" een rijk programma dat erfgoed, kennis en cultuur combineert en deze locatie omvormt tot een niet te missen ontmoetingsplaats voor de Brusselaars.","longdescr":"De vzw Horizon 50-200 geeft een nieuw elan met een sterke ambitie voor  2030, dankzij de steun van de spelers van de Nationale Loterij.\n\nIn de aanloop naar het tweehonderdjarig bestaan van Belgi\u00eb in 2030 nodigt het Jubelpark u uit om zijn uitzonderlijke museumcollecties en het park te herontdekken vanuit een nieuw perspectief, een van vernieuwing en ontmoeting. Het evenement Horizon 2030 biedt een waaier aan festiviteiten en activiteiten op deze iconische locatie, die garant staan voor onvergetelijke momenten met vrienden en familie.\n\nHorizon 2030 is een mix van traditie en innovatie en brengt populaire evenementen zoals het Bright Festival, de 20 km van Brussel en de Nationale Feestdag samen met nieuwe evenementen rond erfgoed, wetenschappelijk onderzoek en cultuur. U kunt tentoonstellingen, workshops, lezingen en ontspanningsmomenten ontdekken in het park en zijn musea, met de steun van de instellingen en onze partners.\n\nVanaf de lente tot het einde van de zomer zien we u graag in het Jubelpark.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.horizon2030bxl.be","email":"info@bmeo.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 64 70","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009618"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:22+02:00","id":235980,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Parc du Cinquentenaire in Br\u00fcssel","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-gardens.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Der 1880 anl\u00e4sslich des 50. Jahrestags der Unabh\u00e4ngigkeit Belgiens angelegte Parc du Cinquantenaire ist eine Gartenanlage im \u201efranz\u00f6sischen Stil\u201c mit historischer Bedeutung. Hier kann man neben Gartenkunst auch Denkm\u00e4ler, Skulpturen und Museen bewundern. \u00dcberragt wird der Park von einem Triumphbogen mit drei Arkaden, auf denen eine bronzene Quadriga prangt. Von hier aus k\u00f6nnen Besucher einen atemberaubenden Blick auf die belgische Hauptstadt genie\u00dfen. Die breiten Alleen f\u00fchren unter anderem zum Pavillon der menschlichen Leidenschaften aus der Feder des ber\u00fchmten Jugendstilarchitekten Victor Horta, zum K\u00f6niglichen Armee- und Milit\u00e4rmuseum, zum Museum f\u00fcr Kunst & Geschichte und zum Automuseum Autoworld.\r\n\r\nGanzj\u00e4hrig finden hier zudem Veranstaltungen aller Art statt: Sportveranstaltungen, Feste, Konzerte, Feuerwerk... Im Sommer l\u00e4dt Sie das Park-Caf\u00e9 \u201eGuinguette Maurice\u201c zu einer sonnigen Pause ein.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Parque do Cinquenten\u00e1rio","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-gardens.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"O local \u00e9 um vasto conjunto de jardins, pontuado por monumentos e museus. \u00c9 dominado por um arco do triunfo de tr\u00eas arcadas: o Cinquenten\u00e1rio. O parque acolhe numerosas atividades ao longo de todo o ano: manifesta\u00e7\u00f5es, festas, fogos de artif\u00edcio, eventos desportivos, concertos\u2026 O local foi constru\u00eddo em 1880 para o 50.\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio da independ\u00eancia da B\u00e9lgica. As grandes vias levam ao Pavilh\u00e3o das Paix\u00f5es Humanas, desenhado por Victor Horta, ao Museu Real das For\u00e7as Armadas e da Hist\u00f3ria Militar, aos Museus Reais de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria e \u00e0 Autoworld. No \u00e1pice dos tr\u00eas arcos triunfais, uma quadriga de bronze e um panorama com vista deslumbrante de Bruxelas inteira. Equipamentos: -Bancos -Mesas de piquenique -Chafarizes -Parque infantil 3-7 anos -Parque infantil 7-12 anos -Campo polidesportivo -Espregui\u00e7adeiras (no ver\u00e3o) Acessibilidade: a entrada do lado Schuman foi toda especialmente adaptada neste sentido. O revestimento das vias \u00e9 conveniente para os carrinhos. Aqui e ali, s\u00e3o atravessadas por canais pouco profundos. Ladrilhado redondo na esplanada.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Cinquantenaire Park","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-gardens.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Built in 1880 to mark the 50th anniversary of Belgium's independence, Cinquantenaire Park is both a collection of French-style gardens and a historical site that's home to monuments, sculptures and museums. It's dominated by a triumphal arch with three arches and a bronze quadriga at its summit, which offers a stunning panoramic view of the capital. The wide paths lead to the Pavilion of Human Passions designed by Victor Horta, the Royal Museum of the Armed Forces and Military History, the Art & History Museum and Autoworld, the car museum.\r\n\r\nTake part in events here throughout the year: sporting events, festivals, concerts, fireworks... In the summer, you can enjoy a short break at the Guinguette Maurice pop-up bar.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Parco del Cinquantenario, natura e cultura nel centro di Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-gardens.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Il Parc du Cinquantenaire, polmone verde di Bruxelles, \u00e8 un'oasi di pace nel mezzo del Quartiere Europeo.\u00a0\r\n\r\nRifugio tranquillo in mezzo alla tempesta delle automobili, il parco cela dei veri e propri tesori : la Grande Moschea, la statua del cane verde o il Pavillon des passions humaines di Victor Horta.\u00a0\r\nUbicato tra la rotonda Schuman, le avenues des Nerviens, de la Renaissance e de Tervueren, il Parco del Cinquantenario copre una trentina di ettari di giardino classico, con vialetti tracciati da funi, siepi di allori potati e un tracciato simmetrico. Il Museo del Cinquantenario, i Musei d'Arte e di Storia Militare e Autoworld sono ospitati all'interno della grande costruzione del Cinquantenario.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-gardens.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-gardens.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Construit en 1880 pour le 50e anniversaire de l\u2019ind\u00e9pendance de la Belgique, le parc du Cinquantenaire est \u00e0 la fois un ensemble de jardins \u00ab\u00a0\u00e0 la fran\u00e7aise\u00a0\u00bb et un site historique o\u00f9 d\u00e9couvrir monuments, sculptures et mus\u00e9es. Il est domin\u00e9 par un arc de triomphe \u00e0 trois arcades avec, au sommet, un quadrige de bronze et un panorama avec une vue imprenable sur la capitale. Les grandes all\u00e9es vous conduisent au Pavillon des Passions humaines dessin\u00e9 par Victor Horta, au Mus\u00e9e Royal de l'Arm\u00e9e et d'Histoire Militaire, au Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire et \u00e0 Autoworld, le mus\u00e9e de l\u2019automobile.\r\n\r\nParticipez \u00e0 des manifestations tout au long de l\u2019ann\u00e9e\u00a0: \u00e9v\u00e8nements sportifs, f\u00eates, concerts, feux d\u2019artifice\u2026 En \u00e9t\u00e9, la guinguette Maurice vous accueille pour une petite pause.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Parque del Cincuentenario","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-gardens.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El Cincuentenario est\u00e1 compuesto por un amplio conjunto de jardines llenos de monumentos y museos. Destaca por su por su arco de triunfo compuesto por tres arcos. El parque acoge numerosas actividades a lo largo del a\u00f1o: eventos, celebraciones, espect\u00e1culos de fuegos artificiales, eventos deportivos, conciertos, etc.. \r\nEste lugar de inter\u00e9s fue construido en 1880 por el 50\u00ba aniversario de la independencia de B\u00e9lgica. Sus amplios caminos llevan hacia el Templo de las pasiones humanas, dise\u00f1ado por Victor Horta, el Real Museo de las Fuerzas armadas y de Historia Militar, el Museo Real de Arte e Historia y el Autoworld. En la parte superior de los tres arcos de triunfo hay una cuadriga y una vista impresionante de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nInstalaciones: \r\n- Bancos\r\n- Mesas de p\u00edcnic\r\n- Fuentes \r\n- Parques para ni\u00f1os de 3 a 7 a\u00f1os\r\n- Parques para ni\u00f1os de 7 a 12 a\u00f1os\r\n- Una pista deportiva polivalente\r\n- Tumbonas (en verano)\r\n\r\nAccesibilidad: \r\nLa entrada por Schuman ha sido especialmente dise\u00f1ada teniendo esto en mente. El camino est\u00e1 adecuado para sillas de ruedas. Aqu\u00ed y all\u00e1 encontrar\u00e1s peque\u00f1os caminos rodeando la explanada.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Jubelpark","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brussels-gardens.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Jubelpark werd in 1880 aangelegd ter gelegenheid van de 50e verjaardag van de Belgische onafhankelijkheid. Het park bestaat uit een aantal tuinen in Franse stijl. Maar het is vooral een historische site met veel monumenten, beeldhouwwerken en musea. Centraal staat de gigantische triomfboog. Die telt drie bogen, een bronzen vierspan helemaal bovenaan en een panoramisch uitzicht over de hoofdstad. In het park leiden de brede lanen je naar het Paviljoen der Menselijke Driften (ontworpen door Victor Horta), het Koninklijk Museum van het Leger en de Krijgsgeschiedenis, de Koninklijke Musea voor Kunst en Geschiedenis en Autoworld, het automuseum.\r\n\r\nJe kan er het hele jaar door naar sportevenementen, feesten, concerten, vuurwerk... In de zomer vind je er ook de Guinguette Maurice.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_i