ps:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001782"},"cn":{"name":"Erasmusica concerts","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/erasmushouse.museum\/2022\/09\/concerts-de-midi-erasmusica-2\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001782"},"fr":{"name":"Concerts de midi Erasmusica & pr\u00e9ludes litt\u00e9raires","shortdescr":"Concerts de musique ancienne et pr\u00e9ludes litt\u00e9raires","longdescr":"11:00 > 12:00 Pr\u00e9lude litt\u00e9raire (FR)\n12:30 > 13:15 Concert\n\n- Nouveau ! Pr\u00e9ludes litt\u00e9raires \u2013 Introduction au concert\nL\u2019\u00e9quipe de la biblioth\u00e8que de l\u2019Espace Car\u00eame fera d\u00e9couvrir les livres sur le th\u00e8me de la musique ou sur des th\u00e8mes choisis au gr\u00e9 des envies, passions et saisons.\nRejoignez-la pour \u00e9changer des conseils, des recommandations et des coups de coeur litt\u00e9raires.\n\n- Concerts\nLes \u00e9tudiants de la section HIPP (Historical Performance Practice) du Koninklijk Conservatorium Brussel vous invitent \u00e0 \u00e9couter chaque mois les sonorit\u00e9s subtiles et uniques de la musique ancienne interpr\u00e9t\u00e9e sur des instruments d\u2019\u00e9poque. Les musiciens vous proposent un voyage \u00e0 travers toute l\u2019Europe. A chaque \u00e9dition, c\u2019est un programme surprise vari\u00e9 qui vous est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9, accompagn\u00e9 d\u2019explications et d\u2019anecdotes tout au long du concert.\n\n\u2013 Gratuit et sans r\u00e9servation\n\u2013 Le pr\u00e9lude litt\u00e9raire est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 par l\u2019\u00e9quipe de la Biblioth\u00e8que de l\u2019Espace Maurice Car\u00eame, rue du Chapelain 1-7, 1070 Anderlecht\n\u2013 Le concert se d\u00e9roule dans la salle de la Muziekacademie Anderlecht, Place de la Vaillance, 5, 1070 Anderlecht\n\u2013 Les portes ferment \u00e0 12:25, le concert commence \u00e0 12:30\n\n","performers":"Les \u00e9tudiants de la section HIPP (Historical Performance Practice) du Koninklijk Conservatorium Brussel \nL'\u00e9quipe de la biblioth\u00e8que Maurice Car\u00eame\n\n\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/erasmushouse.museum\/2022\/09\/concerts-de-midi-erasmusica-2\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001782"},"sp":{"name":"Erasmusica concerts","shortdescr":"M\u00fasica antigua","longdescr":"11:00 > 12:00 h. Preludio literario (FR, Biblioteca de l\u2019Espace Maurice Car\u00eame)\n12:30 > 13:15 h. Concierto\n\nLos estudiantes del departamento HIPP (Pr\u00e1ctica hist\u00f3rica de la interpretaci\u00f3n) del Koninklijk Conservatorium Brussel ofrecen un bello programa para introducirnos en la m\u00fasica antigua.\n\nGratuito y sin necesidad de reserva\nLos conciertos tienen lugar en la sala de la Muziekacademie Anderlecht (Place de la Vaillance, 5 - 1070 Anderlecht)\n","performers":"Estudiantes del departamento HIPP (Pr\u00e1ctica hist\u00f3rica de la interpretaci\u00f3n) del Koninklijk Conservatorium Brussel","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/erasmushouse.museum\/2022\/09\/concerts-de-midi-erasmusica-2\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001782"},"nl":{"name":"Middagconcerten Erasmusica","shortdescr":"BAROK- EN KLASSIEKE MUZIEK CONCERTEN","longdescr":"11:00 > 12:00 Pr\u00e9lude litt\u00e9raire (FR, Biblioth\u00e8que de l\u2019Espace Maurice Car\u00eame)\n12:30 > 13:15 Concert\n\nEen keer per maand nodigen de studenten van de afdeling Historical Performance Practice van het Koninklijk Conservatorium Brussel u uit te luisteren naar de subtiele en unieke klanken van de barok- en klassieke muziek, uitgevoerd op historische instrumenten. Tijdens een middagconcert nemen zij u mee op een muzikale reis doorheen Europa. Wij gidsen u telkens door een gevarieerd en verrassend programma aan de hand van uitleg en anekdotes.\n\n\u2013 De deuren sluiten om 12.25 uur, het concert begint precies om 12.30 uur.\n\u2013 Gratis en zonder reservatie!\n\u2013 De concert vindt plaats in de zaal van de Muziekacademie Anderlecht (Dapperheidsplein 5 \u2013 1070 Anderlecht)","performers":"Studenten van de afdeling Historical Performance Practice van het Koninklijk Conservatorium","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/erasmushouse.museum\/nl\/2022\/09\/middagconcerten-erasmusica-2\/","email":"info@erasmushouse.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 13 83","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001782"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2021-08-21T04:11:46+02:00","published_at":"2016-02-15T20:34:39+01:00","id":265380,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Muziekacademie Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Place de la Vaillance","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"dir@ma-an.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ma-an.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 522 05 51","phone_booking":"+32 2 522 05 51","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Place de la Vaillance, 5","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Muziekacademie Anderlecht","address_street_name":"Place de la Vaillance","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"dir@ma-an.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ma-an.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 522 05 51","phone_booking":"+32 2 522 05 51","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Place de la Vaillance, 5","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"na