ip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Place Charles Rogier","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Belfius Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Place Charles Rogier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"artcollection@belfius.be","website":"http:\/\/www.belfius-art-collection.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Place Charles Rogier","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Belfius Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Place Charles Rogier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"artcollection@belfius.be","website":"http:\/\/www.belfius-art-collection.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Place Charles Rogier","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"La collection Belfius est la plus grande collection d\u2019art belge du pays. La collection compte plus de 4 300 \u0153uvres d\u2019art et r\u00e9sulte de la fusion des collections du Cr\u00e9dit communal de Belgique, de Paribas Banque Belgique et de BACOB Banque.\r\n\r\nApr\u00e8s la Deuxi\u00e8me Guerre Mondiale, tant le Cr\u00e9dit communal que Paribas Belgique ont commenc\u00e9 \u00e0 acqu\u00e9rir des \u0153uvres de grande valeur li\u00e9es \u00e0 l\u2019h\u00e9ritage national belge, afin d\u2019\u00e9viter qu\u2019elles ne disparaissent \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9tranger. D\u00e8s le d\u00e9but, le Cr\u00e9dit communal a mis l\u2019accent sur l\u2019art belge \u00e0 partir de 1860, tandis que Paribas se concentrait principalement sur des \u0153uvres du 16e au 18e si\u00e8cle et sur l\u2019art contemporain. BACOB banque a commenc\u00e9 sa collection en 1980 et s\u2019est exclusivement consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019art contemporain belge. Aujourd\u2019hui, la collection couvre pr\u00e8s de cinq si\u00e8cles.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Belfius Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Place Charles Rogier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"artcollection@belfius.be","website":"http:\/\/www.belfius-art-collection.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Place Charles Rogier","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Belfius Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Charles Rogierplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"artcollection@belfius.be","website":"http:\/\/www.belfius-art-collection.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Charles Rogierplein","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"De Belfius-kunstcollectie is de grootste verzameling van Belgische kunst van het land en omvat meer dan 4300 werken, het gevolg van de samensmelting van de kunstverzamelingen van het Gemeentekrediet, Paribas Bank Belgi\u00eb en BACOB Bank.\r\n\r\nZowel het Gemeentekrediet als Paribas Belgi\u00eb begonnen na de Tweede Wereldoorlog met het verzamelen van waardevolle kunstwerken uit het nationaal erfgoed om te vermijden dat ze naar het buitenland verdwenen. Het Gemeentekrediet legde van in het begin het accent op Belgische kunst vanaf 1860, terwijl Paribas Belgi\u00eb kunst uit de 16de tot de 18de eeuw en moderne kunst kocht. BACOB bank begon zijn verzameling in 1980 en legde zich uitsluitend toe op Belgische hedendaagse kunst. Vandaag bestrijkt de collectie werken uit bijna vijf eeuwen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[15],"translations":{"de":["Rogier"],"pt":[null],"en":["Rogier"],"it":["Rogier"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Rogier"],"sp":["Rogier"],"nl":["Rogier"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":26601,"location":{"lat":50.85559436,"lon":4.35809247},"region":"brussels","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"last_updated_at":"2023-06-08T12:25:28+02:00","published_at":"2021-07-23T14:48:31+02:00","id":276946,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Since 1983, Arkadia has been exploring the richness of Belgium's and Brussels' heritage and developing numerous cultural projects especially in Brussels, between architecture, urbanism, culture, plastic arts and ideology from the Middle Ages to the present day. Seeing and understanding the city and its architectural development, approaching artistic creation and giving it meaning, these are the activities that the ASBL wants to share with the public. Specialists in architectural heritage and contemporary art, they show the city through guided tours and lectures in several languages.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 1983, Arkadia explore les richesses du patrimoine belge et bruxellois et d\u00e9veloppe de nombreux projets culturels sp\u00e9cialement \u00e0 Bruxelles, entre architecture, urbanisme, culture, arts plastiques et id\u00e9ologie depuis le Moyen \u00c2ge jusqu\u2019\u00e0 nos jours. Voir et comprendre la ville et son d\u00e9veloppement architectural, approcher la cr\u00e9ation artistique et lui donner un sens, telles sont les activit\u00e9s que l'ASBL veut partager avec le public. Sp\u00e9cialistes du patrimoine  architectural et de l'art contemporain, ils font d\u00e9couvrir la ville \u00e0 travers des visites guid\u00e9es et des conf\u00e9rences en plusieurs langues.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Naamsestraat","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/nl","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Naamsestraat, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds 1983 verkent Arkadia de rijkdom van het Belgische en Brusselse erfgoed en ontwikkelt talrijke culturele projecten, vooral in Brussel, tussen architectuur, stedenbouw, cultuur, plastische kunsten en ideologie, van 